(corpus-ch4-048)
*trajectory 1 vehicle start on 1
  *initial geodetic
    long=0 lat=0 alt=0 vel=0 gama=0 psi=90 time=0 wt=1
  *segment 1 test
    *when tmark>25 goto 6
    *when alphat>5 goto 11
  *segment 6 synthetic target
    *when time>1 stop
  *segment 11 synthetic target
    *when time>1 stop
*end
